# Context pruning for THIS Dockerfile only.
#
# BuildKit prefers `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` over the context root's
# `.dockerignore`, which is why this lives here: the repository root has no
# .dockerignore, and adding one would silently change what
# docker/backend/Dockerfile and the two frontend images see.
#
# The build context is the repository root (see docker-compose.yml), and this
# image copies nothing but packages/. Everything else is upload time.
*
!packages/

# Build output and tool caches inside the packages that ARE copied. A local
# `dart pub get` or a native-asset build leaves hundreds of megabytes here, and
# copying it in would also hand the builder a .dart_tool/package_config.json
# full of absolute host paths.
packages/*/.dart_tool/
packages/*/build/
packages/*/.packages
packages/*/pubspec.lock
**/.DS_Store
